            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Alguma tendência nesta semana?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve this computer on your other device; it was active in the last week.": {
      "comment": "Not stored: transient message core renders in English only; the shells localize it by code (Task 4).",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Genehmigen Sie diesen Computer auf Ihrem anderen Gerät; er war in der letzten Woche aktiv."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Aprueba esta computadora en tu otro dispositivo; estuvo activa en la última semana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Approuvez cet ordinateur sur votre autre appareil ; il était actif la semaine dernière."
          }
